        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralf D. Bode, Sissy Spacek, Loretta\n- Works: Coal Miner's Daughter\n- Awards: Academy Award nomination, Academy Award for Best Actress\n\nFacts:\n- Ralf Detlef Bode was born on March 31, 1941, and died on February 27, 2001.\n- Ralf Detlef Bode was a German-born American cinematographer.\n- Ralf Detlef Bode was best known for his Academy Award-nominated work on the film \"Coal Miner's Daughter.\"\n- The film \"Coal Miner's Daughter\" stars Sissy Spacek as Loretta.\n- Sissy Spacek won the Academy Award for Best Actress for her role as Loretta in \"Coal Miner's Daughter.\"",
